Add remote show/edit/import/export/preview/apply/status/rollback/probe operations using the management API; include OAuth login/refresh and secure credential sourcing or explicit scoped-token compatibility. Define local stdio/bootstrap and legacy CLI behavior without editing dormant global files. Acceptance: CLI tests cover conflicts, auth expiry, failures, redaction and target selection; one remote edit works without SSH or manual YAML modification.
